<title>LITHUANIA: Yields fall on 182-day Lithuanian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Yields fall on 182-day Lithuanian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields fell on 182-day Lithuanian Treasury bills at Tuesday's auction and all of the 50 million litas issue was sold as it was oversubscribed, the country's central bank said.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   LAST   MIN/MAX  ISSUE  BID    SOLD</p>
<p> 182-day	9.18     9.64   9.00/9.60  50  89.643  50</p>
<p>The settlement date is July 11 and the bills mature on January 9, 1998.</p>
<p>The next auction is on July 14 when 50 million litas of 91-day paper will be sold.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
